{"id":"vod_md_2531","vodId":"2531","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"日常","name_cn":"日常","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"26集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230815-1/96bab94d94d6f306e6175aa78ca77e00.jpg"},"summary":"表面上看来，东云名乃（古谷静佳 配音）是一个外表可爱又有点天然呆的黑发女孩，可是，她背后醒目的发条暴露了她的真实身份——由博士（今野宏美 配音）所改造的少女机器人。虽然对于自己背后的发条感到十分自卑，但博士总是以其非常可爱为由拒绝帮助名乃进行改造。在名乃就读的1年纪Q班中，汇聚着名乃的诸多好友们——个性过于活泼以至于经常暴走的相生祐子（本多真梨子 配音），常常陷于对同性恋情的幻想之中的美术型女生长野原美绪（相泽舞 配音），以及外表沉默安静内里腹黑毒舌的三好学生水上麻衣（富樫美铃 配音）。就这样，经常处于脱线状态的日常和激烈的吐槽在这三人之间展开了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-15 08:17:07","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/3CABhwpT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/LufRAEz1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/Nn7Ow1yq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/YZ7YzaPB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/5HZhT6RY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/8Cr6vEsI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/Kh6eFJ1g/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/Ub3VE2Op/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/8vXWQYL1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/amMGpY87/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/rlR634mB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/vDPispoO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/SctFyEoz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/nw0u6byF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230814/SqQNgxph/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"ht